                "text": "The House passed a Full-Year Continuing Resolution\n\u2705Avoids a government shutdown on Friday\n\u2705Fully funds Medicaid, Medicare & Social Security \n\u2705Provides increase for Veterans Toxic Exposure Fund\n\u2705Secures our borders\n\u2705Freezes current government funding levels \nClick the link for more details and watch my video statement about the bill:\nhttps://t.co/MgTZr95PuA",
