                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The House just passed a $9.4 Billion Rescissions Package to eliminate wasteful taxpayer spending, on things like: \n\u274cNet Zero Cities in Mexico \n\u274cElectric buses in Rwanda \n\u274cSexual reproductive health in Venezuela \n\u274cNPR's taxpayer-funded stories about \"queer animals\" \n\nTaxpayers shouldn't be funding those initiatives. We are putting America first and restoring confidence in taxpayer-funded programs. \n\nRead more @ https://t.co/2tqtFk03sY",
