                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Kentucky has been awarded nearly $213 million for 2026 from the Rural Health Transformation Fund through the Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services. The new $50 billion fund for rural healthcare was part of the Working Families Tax Cuts legislation that I voted for earlier this year. Over the next 5 years, funding will be provided through this program exclusively to advance rural healthcare. \n\nVisit my website for the full press release: https://t.co/qP33ojrNQs",
